error[E0501]: cannot prove the refinement `(0 <= (i + k)) && ((i + k) < (size arr))`
  --> tests/cirkalang/verify/fail/overflow.cirka:11:75
   |
11 | get arr i k = if 0 <= i && 0 <= k && i + k < A.size arr then A.index arr (i + k) else 0
   |                                                                           ^^^^^ in `Main.get`
   = note: counterexample: i = 1, k = 9223372036854775807, primArraySize arr = 9223372036854775807
   = help: check the value, add a condition (`if`), or refine the type of what it is computed from
